## ۴. کد نمونه

```python {title="example.py"}
def hello(name):
    print(f"Hello, {name}!")
    return True

hello("Markup+")
```

```javascript {title="app.js"}
const greet = (name) => {
    console.log(`Hello, ${name}!`);
};
greet("World");
```

